es Blog Caselaw Digest Commercial Law Commercial Law Company Law Constitutional Law Constitutional Law Constitutions of Nations Criminal Law and Procedure Customary Law Customary Law and Procedure Environmental Law Family Law Forms and Precedents General Human Rights Law Human Rights Law Insurance Intellectual Property Law International Law Jurisprudence Labour Law Land Cases Land Law Laws of the Federation of Nigeria Legislations Matrimonial Cases Oil and Gas Oil and Gas Legislations Practice and Procedure Probate Matters Rules Rulings Statutes Torts Torts Law Uncategorized Generic selectors Exact matches only Search in title Search in content Post Type Selectors LINKSHome Our Team Articles Arbitration Commercial Law Company Law Constitutional Law Criminal Law and Procedure Customary Law and Procedure Family Law Environmental Law General Human Rights Law Insurance Intellectual Property Law International Law Jurisprudence Labour Law Maritime Law Oil and Gas Practice and Procedure Revenue Law Torts HOW TO TENDER AND PLAY VIDEO EVIDENCE IN COURT Caselaw Digest Legislations Constitutions of Nations Laws of the Federation of Nigeria Oil and Gas Legislations Rules Statutes Judgments Chieftaincy Matters Commercial Law Constitutional Law Criminal Law Customary Law Election Cases Environmental Law General Human Rights Law Insurance Law Labour Law Land Cases Matrimonial Cases Probate Matters Rulings Torts Law Forms and Precedents Legal Extras Blog Articles Top 7 Mistakes Every Personal Injury Lawyer Should Avoid in Their Career Contact RECENT POSTS EDO STATE CUSTOMARY COURTS LAW AMALACHUKWU O. IGWEOKOLO V. IGWENAGU OSITA CHRISTIAN IME NYA AKPAN V. EDIMA AKPAN OGHALE EMMANUEL USEH V. PRECIOUS USEH DR. UABOI OVBIAGELE V. MRS. JULIET OVBIAGELE ARCHIVES July 2026 (28) June 2026 (22) May 2026 (2) April 2026 (4) March 2026 (5) February 2026 (6) January 2026 (2) December 2025 (1) October 2025 (4) September 2025 (1) July 2025 (3) June 2025 (12) May 2025 (11) April 2025 (3) March 202